    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31960" root="غضب" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضُوبٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضْبَانُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Stern,</i> or <i>austere,</i>

<i>in look,</i> or <i>countenance;</i> applied to a woman: (S,
O, K:) and in like manner applied to a she-camel: (O, K:) or thus applied to a she-camel:
and also signifying <i>a company of women.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A malignant serpent.</i> (O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضْبٌ</span>.

